arest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s2","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"Each experiment was repeated 3 times with different random seeds.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s3","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"We trained each model for 30 epochs with a batch size of 128.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s4","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"Figure 1 shows the test accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s5","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"As shown in Figure 1, DistilBERT reaches 57.1% test accuracy on SVHN.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s6","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"On IMDB, MLP is 53.2 points better than VGG-16 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s7","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"On Fashion-MNIST, MLP obtains a test accuracy of 60%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s8","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"DistilBERT outperforms ViT-S by 3 percentage points on IMDB.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s9","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"Figure 2 shows the accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s10","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"MLP attains a accuracy of 99.9% at epoch 8.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s11","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"As shown in Figure 2, MLP reaches 83.1% accuracy at epoch 4.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s12","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"MLP attains a accuracy of 86.7% at epoch 3 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s13","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"From epoch 5 to epoch 6, the accuracy of MLP improves by a relative 1.2%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s14","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"Figure 3 shows the training loss.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s15","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"As shown in Figure 3, at epoch 50, the loss of Ours is 0.422.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s16","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"Baseline has a loss of 0.156 at epoch 30.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s17","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"XGBoost reaches 78.1% accuracy on Fashion-MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_019_s18","report_id":"holdout_019","text":"We note that the training was stable for all models.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}